    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38806" root="مكث" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكِيثٌ</span></b>  <i>Grave:</i> (S, K:) <i>who does not hasten
in his affair:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكَثَآءُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكِيثُونَ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكِيثُ الكَلَامِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Slow of speech.</i> (Ibn-Abi-l-
Hadeed.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكِيثٌ</span> A man <i>remaining;
staying; abiding; remaining fixed,</i> or <i>stationary.</i>
(TA.)

